# A real binary AndroidManifest.xml, base64, so both the shell fixture
# generator and the JVM test put the same bytes in the fake app shell.
# apksigner refuses an APK whose manifest it cannot parse, which is how
# a plain-text placeholder was found out. Compiled once with aapt2 from
# a manifest declaring package io.github.muness.fixture, minSdk 26.
